A panel of picture buttons, like the ones on big game wikis' front pages. Put [[Template:Tile]] calls inside it.

<pre>
{{Tiles|title=Equipment|icon=Cinder icon sword.png|
{{Tile|Weapons|image=Cinder tile weapons.png|text=Blades, axes and spears}}
{{Tile|Bows and Ranged|image=Cinder tile bows.png}}
{{Tile|Baubles|image=Cinder tile baubles.png}}
}}
</pre>

{{Tiles|title=Example|
{{Tile|Weapons|text=Blades, axes and spears}}
{{Tile|Spells}}
{{Tile|Classes|text=Archetypes and subclasses}}
}}

* <code>title</code> and <code>icon</code> are optional; without a title the panel has no heading.
* <code>size=small</code> or <code>size=large</code> changes the picture size (64 or 128 pixels; normal is 96).
* Tiles wrap onto new rows by themselves and stack on phones.

